sequenceDiagram
    participant W as Android SyncWorker
    participant API
    participant PG as PostgreSQL
    participant FS as Server filesystem

    W->>API: PUT /v1/recordings/{id} manifest
    API->>PG: idempotent metadata transaction
    API-->>W: artifacts + stored offsets
    loop Each incomplete artifact
        W->>API: HEAD /v1/artifacts/{id}/content
        API-->>W: Upload-Offset
        loop Chunks
            W->>API: PATCH content + Upload-Offset
            API->>FS: append to .part
            API->>PG: stored_size_bytes
            API-->>W: next Upload-Offset
        end
        W->>API: POST /v1/artifacts/{id}/complete
        API->>FS: verify SHA-256 + atomic rename
        API->>PG: storage_status=available
    end
    W->>API: POST /v1/recordings/{id}/complete
    API->>PG: verify expected artifacts, ingest_status=complete
    API-->>W: server receipt
    W->>W: local sync_status=synced
